PROJECT
===============================================================================

Bharat Ballot is an AI-powered Digital Election Management Platform designed,
developed, and owned by Team RawJet.

This project includes, but is not limited to:

• Source Code
• Frontend Applications
• Backend APIs
• AI Face Recognition Service
• Database Design
• User Interface
• Documentation
• Architecture
• Graphics
• Images
• Logos
• Project Branding

All intellectual property rights associated with Bharat Ballot remain the
exclusive property of Team RawJet.

